# Assault troops: one volley close in, then the bayonet.
drill "Shock"
about "One volley close in, then the bayonet. Never waits, rarely breaks."
type Grenadier
dials aggression 0.95 discipline 0.60 cohesion 0.70 cover 0.10 patience 0.25 nerve 0.70

sergeant:
  when smoke between us and enemy within 50 -> charge
  when enemy within 35 and not enemy outnumbers us by 30% -> charge

man:
  otherwise -> follow sergeant
